<description>:d10-1:
Auction Ends: December 8th sometime between 8-11pm EST.

:d10-2:
Ships From: NJ, 07506.
Ships To: Continuous US only.
Please include zip code when you bid or put LOCAL if you'd prefer to meet up!

:d10-3:Rules of Auction:
- Some games have a HARD RESERVE (HR) posted. This is minimum dollar figure that I can guarantee a sale.
- Some games have a SOFT RESERVE (SR). If the ending bid is below this figure, I may still sell it, within reason, but that will be at my discretion.
- All bids must be at least $1 increments.
- I reserve the right to end or cancel the auction at any time.
- I reserve the right to remove any games from the auction at any time.
- Not looking to trade at this moment.
- Please don't bid if you don't intend on buying the game.
- Please no contingency bids.

:d10-4:Game Conditions:
- Most items are NIS or in excellent condition, unless stated otherwise.
- All games come from a pet-free and smoke-free household.
- If a game contains an expansion, it will be listed with the game.

:d10-5:Transactions:
- BGG marketplace will get their 3%.
- Payment via Zelle or PAYPAL Friends and Family is preferred. If, chosing Goods and Services, a 3.2% fee will be added to the total.
- Payment to be made within 48 hours of auction end.

:d10-6:Shipping:
- Buyer will cover the shipping costs.
- Games will ship using lowest cost via PirateShip. If you desire specific service please let me know.
- I will combine shipping if winning multiple items.
- I will do my best to ship within a week after payment.

🎲Happy bidding!🎲</description>

